{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01","cat":"favorite","group":{"id":"fav1021","label":"Moran"},"label":"The Awkward Thrill of First Times","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"treasurestory_moran_02","speakers":{"moran":"Moran","jin":"Jin"},"icons":{"moran":"si_c281_00_s","jin":"si_c922_00_s"},"notes":["Favorite item quest step: Enter the Outpost"],"lines":[{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_1","text":"*Gulp*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Hotel","bgArt":"hotel","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_crawlinganxiety","movie":null,"shown":["moran"],"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_2","text":"So... today has finally come.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_3","text":"Wait, it's today, right? I didn't get it mixed up, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_4","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_4","text":"Moran checks the calendar and only then smiles as if relieved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_5","text":"Okay, today's the day for sure!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_6","text":"Hang on, what am I supposed to do at the movie theater again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_languor","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_7","text":"I'm sure I looked it up, but I've already forgotten! Gosh, I'm an idiot!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_8","text":"I know I searched like this... Ah, there it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_9","text":"Let's see... First, take advantage of the darkness to hold the other person's hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_10","text":"Second, lean on them during an emotional scene.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_11","text":"Third, if there's a scary scene, jump into that person's—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_12","text":"What's got you staring so hard?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["jin"],"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_13","text":"Agh!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_14","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_14","text":"*Crash!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_15","text":"Y-you! When did you get here?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["moran"],"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_16","text":"Just now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_17","text":"And don't start on me about the knocking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_18","text":"I kept at it, but you didn't answer, so I just came in. Figured something might've happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_19","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_19","text":"Jin glances at the calendar out of the corner of his eye.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_20","text":"Well, well... Looks like something's happening today, huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_21","text":"Is today your little date? No wonder you've been grinning—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_22","text":"N-n-n-no!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_23","text":"What do you mean \"no\"? You've been counting down the days for a while now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_24","text":"Every day, you ask what day it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_25","text":"And c'mon, Moran, this is your first date.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_26","text":"Hey! How'd you know that?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_27","text":"How could I not know?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_28","text":"I can read you like a book.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_29","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_30","text":"Sometimes when I look at you, you remind me of my mom.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_31","text":"... Sorry, but I don't want a daughter like you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_32","text":"A daughter like Sakura, though... Now we're talking...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_33","text":"What?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_34","text":"Get over here! I'll teach you a lesson!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_35","text":"Anyway, Moran... since it's your very first date, you're not seriously going out like that, are you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_36","text":"!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_37","text":"Wh-what?! What's wrong with it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_38","text":"Do I... not look good?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_39","text":"It's not that... You just look like you always do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_40","text":"No!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_41","text":"I spent a very long time washing myself today!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_42","text":"I even put on scented body lotion!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_43","text":"And... and I put on something called lip... lip gloss too!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_44","text":"I can't tell at all, Moran.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_45","text":"You gotta wear something that really stands out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_moran_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"jin","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_moran_01_46","text":"Don't you have 